[en.SP_OIL_ROCKET]
Fossil Propeller

[en.SP_OIL_ROCKET_desc]
The principle of the fossil fuel propeller is similar to that of the steam propeller, the only difference being that it uses fossil fuel instead of water vapor. Initially, no pony believed that fossil fuels could be used as propeller fuel. However, in an engine experiment, researchers accidentally noticed a unique characteristic of fossil fuels compared to steam power: although the experimental team burned several tons of oil fuel and failed to make the rocket take off, the laboratory’s financial manager, after learning the current oil price, screamed and jumped higher than ever.

[zh.SP_OIL_ROCKET]
化石燃料推进器

[zh.SP_OIL_ROCKET_desc]
化石燃料推进器的原理与蒸汽推进器类似，唯一的区别是它使用的是化石燃料而不是水蒸气。起初，没有小马认为化石燃料可以成为推进器的燃料。然而，在一次引擎实验中，研究者意外注意到了化石燃料相比于蒸气动力的一项独特特性：虽然实验团队燃烧了数吨的石油燃料也没法能成功让火箭起飞，但在得知当前油价后，实验室财务主管尖叫着跳起来的高度比平常高了许多。
